lign with available evidence (e.g., B-cell lymphoid organoids and mass cytometry profiling) or acquire broader immunological perturbation data before claiming comprehensive immune network manipulation."}, {"check_id": "RESULT-ARTIFACT-MISMATCH", "severity": "major", "evidence": [{"id": "source-snapshot:e7d9528c8ec67265fdf076e446fd7cee359584dba60e41868edae3d418927d4a", "locator": {"line_start": 1, "line_end": 525}, "sha256": "70d20034e09f95f1c3cea9f4e5ecc43004fe3373bf32d1f6ff7503dfff2334c3"}, {"id": "source-snapshot:4d9edaa447a746aa39ddc3a645e81517c7b755fe46dcdec3c9c9db6bae3d6816", "locator": {"line_start": 1, "line_end": 2}, "sha256": "af0044a18d0ca8e3a261765db22b9675dbeeaacd2322089a3b6feff0e50765a6"}, {"id": "source-snapshot:9fe214bb4a026b0310437b977b53d875eeadf12eea2401c60fa54ee50ff5e39a", "locator": {"line_start": 1, "line_end": 704}, "sha256": "f8046f04a867c75a6c3a4809a52dc55bd000d157d1bfdaf79846b84811932785"}, {"id": "source-snapshot:08861704d4587675cc21542e4702b386a05f9ec022534d0dc4e7bfc9a568731d", "locator": {"line_start": 1, "line_end": 580}, "sha256": "75e1b7dfc452d67e98ba1a00c26ae20f009951bdaf815ea385eeffda5c465aaf"}], "recommendation": "Develop and document the required SOP, dose-response matrices, and viability controls internally prior to submission, as current sources provide zero procedural validation or threshold definitions."}], "summary": "The proposed human immune-cell perturbation platform relies on fragmented, inaccessible, or erroneous source material. Available evidence consists primarily of publication metadata, a single extraction failure, and a paywalled abstract focusing narrowly on B-cell organoids. Consequently, the rationale overstates the breadth of applicable data, and the specified completion test (validated SOP with dose-response matrices and signaling thresholds) is entirely unsupported. Substantive full-text literature or internal experimental documentation is required to validate the workflow and adjust the scope accordingly."}, 